  "duration_seconds": 372.053,
  "duration_after_vad_seconds": 354.832,
  "cue_count": 72,
  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.72,
      "text": "Should cyclists be forced to wear helmets it's a subject guaranteed to start an argument.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13635,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000795
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 8.78,
      "end": 12.86,
      "text": "Everyone has an opinion. The problem is they're not normally based on evidence.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13635,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000795
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 14.22,
      "end": 18.22,
      "text": "So let's start with something straightforward. I don't have a problem with bike helmets.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13635,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000795
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 19.02,
      "end": 24.22,
      "text": "In fact when I ride a bike I usually wear one and if I fall off my bike and my helmet's properly",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13635,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000795
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 24.22,
      "end": 28.94,
      "text": "fitted and I hit something at low speed the evidence shows it's probably going to help me.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13635,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000795
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 29.74,
      "end": 35.1,
      "text": "So making cyclists wear helmets is a good thing, right? Where here's where it starts to get complicated.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.202344,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001146
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 36.14,
      "end": 39.5,
      "text": "Let's hear first from a doctor who deals directly with head injuries.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.202344,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001146
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 39.5,
      "end": 43.82,
      "text": "I've seen patients with the same devastating skull fractures, brain injuries,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.202344,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001146
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 43.82,
      "end": 48.46,
      "text": "even deland survival brain injuries as the consequence of their head striking the ground.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.202344,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001146
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 49.18,
      "end": 54.38,
      "text": "Last year when I was cycling across America a truck's wing mirror smashed into the back of my head",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.202344,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001146
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 54.38,
      "end": 58.3,
      "text": "at 70 miles an hour knocking me off my bike and onto the road.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.158019,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000674
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 58.3,
      "end": 63.9,
      "text": "But I was lucky. I was wearing a helmet. If I hadn't been I'd be dead.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.158019,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000674
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 65.02,
      "end": 70.94,
      "text": "I honestly wouldn't believe that cyclical helmet legislation was significantly reduced to",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.158019,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000674
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 70.94,
      "end": 73.5,
      "text": "proportional cyclists that are currently killed on our roads.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.158019,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000674
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 74.3,
      "end": 78.86,
      "text": "So it's pretty clear helmets can save lives but let's hear now from another doctor",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.158019,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000674
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 78.86,
      "end": 82.46,
      "text": "one who looks at health not just for individuals but across whole populations.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.158019,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000674
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 83.34,
      "end": 89.9,
      "text": "There are very good indications that forcing people to wear bike helmets",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.085884,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004192
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 90.78,
      "end": 96.14,
      "text": "makes cycling less appealing to people and probably reduces the amount of cycling that",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.085884,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004192
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 96.14,
      "end": 103.1,
      "text": "takes place and there's an overwhelming body of evidence that the health benefits of cycling",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.085884,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004192
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 103.1,
      "end": 106.62,
      "text": "vastly vastly outweigh the health risks.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.085884,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004192
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 107.42,
      "end": 109.9,
      "text": "Also cycling isn't as dangerous as people think.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.085884,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004192
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 110.62,
      "end": 115.02,
      "text": "Here in Britain there's one death for about every 30 million miles cycled.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.107086,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000567
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 115.02,
      "end": 119.9,
      "text": "That's around 100 cyclists killed every year. In fact it's about as safe as walking.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.107086,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000567
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 120.86,
      "end": 126.54,
      "text": "But in that same year well over 85,000 people die early because of illness caused by inactive living.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.107086,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000567
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 127.66,
      "end": 132.7,
      "text": "Many things like heart disease, diabetes and cancer and these are precisely the sort of conditions",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.107086,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000567
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 132.7,
      "end": 135.98,
      "text": "that cycling can play a really really big role in preventing.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.107086,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000567
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 135.98,
      "end": 141.42,
      "text": "Cycling is one of the best ways that we can help fight that I mean cycling as part of transport",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.083863,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000823
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 141.42,
      "end": 145.98,
      "text": "as part of everyday life means that people get a moderate workout regularly.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.083863,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000823
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 145.98,
      "end": 149.58,
      "text": "It's not something that they have to go to the gym to do they can do it on the way to work",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.083863,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000823
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 149.58,
      "end": 151.02,
      "text": "on the way to the shops and so on.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.083863,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000823
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 151.98,
      "end": 159.02,
      "text": "So enforcing the wearing of cycle helmets even if it were the case that it made cycling safer",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.083863,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000823
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 159.02,
      "end": 165.1,
      "text": "would still lead to an overall cost in public health terms.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.083863,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000823
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 165.1,
      "end": 168.06,
      "text": "And something else happens when cyclists put on a helmet.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.12793,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000396
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 168.06,
      "end": 172.86,
      "text": "Something that seems hardwired into our nature. Scientists call it risk compensation.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.12793,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000396
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 173.42,
      "end": 177.58,
      "text": "Basically that means if you have more protection you tend to take more risks.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.12793,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000396
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 177.58,
      "end": 182.46,
      "text": "Yeah we got people into the lab and we told them we were going to look at decision making",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.12793,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000396
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 182.46,
      "end": 188.14,
      "text": "whilst they wore an eye tracking device. It came with a baseball cap or it came with a bicycle",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.12793,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000396
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 188.14,
      "end": 192.22,
      "text": "helmet and then we got this through various decision-making tasks and gambling tasks.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.12793,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000396
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 192.86,
      "end": 196.54,
      "text": "We found that the people who would give him the helmet took more risks on the gambling",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.100084,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000226
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 196.54,
      "end": 199.42,
      "text": "tasks and seemed to show higher sensation seeking measures.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.100084,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000226
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 200.62,
      "end": 205.98,
      "text": "So riders seem to be using that extra protection to be more reckless but here's where it gets",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.100084,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000226
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 205.98,
      "end": 210.7,
      "text": "more scary. Other road users then seem to take more risks with cyclists too.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.100084,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000226
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 211.34,
      "end": 215.5,
      "text": "In another experiment Ian went out on his bike fitted with a measuring device.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.100084,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000226
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 215.5,
      "end": 220.22,
      "text": "Sometimes he wore a helmet sometimes he didn't and he found that when he was wearing the helmet",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.100084,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000226
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 220.22,
      "end": 223.98,
      "text": "the traffic would on average pass in more closely. Sometimes dangerously so.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.082974,
      "no_speech_prob": 8.1e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 225.74,
      "end": 230.46,
      "text": "We had two possible explanations for that. It might just be that if you're wearing a helmet",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.082974,
      "no_speech_prob": 8.1e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 230.46,
      "end": 236.62,
      "text": "you look more experienced and drivers respond to that. Or the other possible explanation was",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.082974,
      "no_speech_prob": 8.1e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 236.62,
      "end": 240.3,
      "text": "drivers were essentially thinking he's protected and can take risks.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.082974,
      "no_speech_prob": 8.1e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 242.91,
      "end": 246.83,
      "text": "So what has happened when countries have made bike helmets compulsory?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.082974,
      "no_speech_prob": 8.1e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 246.83,
      "end": 252.83,
      "text": "Scientists have done major studies in three countries. Canada, New Zealand and Australia.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.170982,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000698
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 252.83,
      "end": 255.95,
      "text": "They try and find out whether helmets improve overall safety.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.170982,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000698
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 257.39,
      "end": 259.55,
      "text": "Keep your head together. Wear a helmet.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.170982,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000698
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 260.11,
      "end": 265.71,
      "text": "Their conclusion? There's no evidence that they do. This is why lots of cycling experts get really",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.170982,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000698
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 265.71,
      "end": 270.11,
      "text": "frustrated when cycle safety campaigns get based around helmets and high-vis only.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.170982,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000698
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 272.22,
      "end": 277.74,
      "text": "Wear a bicycle helmet every time that you ride. Gotta strap it on kids wear your helmets with pride.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.170982,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000698
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 279.1,
      "end": 281.42,
      "text": "Somebody knows these frustrations better than most.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.135653,
      "no_speech_prob": 8.1e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 281.42,
      "end": 285.42,
      "text": "It's Chris Boardman, the former Olympic champion, turn cycle campaigner.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.135653,
      "no_speech_prob": 8.1e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 286.06,
      "end": 291.9,
      "text": "Helmets are quite a divisive topic. They tend to be people's reaction to an environment.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.135653,
      "no_speech_prob": 8.1e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 291.9,
      "end": 296.3,
      "text": "I feel helpless. There's nothing I can do but cycling is a safe activity.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.135653,
      "no_speech_prob": 8.1e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 296.3,
      "end": 299.66,
      "text": "It is the environment that's dangerous. It's that that we need to change.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.135653,
      "no_speech_prob": 8.1e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": 300.78,
      "end": 305.74,
      "text": "The Dutch have spent 40 years building safe bike lanes and over there almost nobody rides",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.135653,
      "no_speech_prob": 8.1e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": 305.74,
      "end": 311.5,
      "text": "wearing a helmet. But in the Netherlands cycling is about four times as safe as it is in Britain.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10916,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000959
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": 312.94,
      "end": 317.66,
      "text": "One thing the Dutch do is removing a lot of the motor traffic from neighbourhoods so that",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10916,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000959
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": 317.66,
      "end": 323.02,
      "text": "residential streets are not really busy with people trying to cut through, avoid the main road,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10916,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000959
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": 323.02,
      "end": 327.34,
      "text": "you know, take a shortcut and so on. I would suggest for people if you want to wear a helmet,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10916,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000959
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": 327.34,
      "end": 331.66,
      "text": "wear a helmet and whatever makes you feel comfortable to ride a bike and I think for",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10916,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000959
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": 331.66,
      "end": 335.42,
      "text": "all of us the message is if there is a freedom to choose, which of course there should be,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.112427,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001328
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": 335.42,
      "end": 341.18,
      "text": "then let it be a freedom, which means I'm not going to impose mine with a lot of you either way.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.112427,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001328
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": 341.18,
      "end": 344.78,
      "text": "In fact, if you look purely at head injuries for all road users,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.112427,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001328
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": 344.78,
      "end": 350.06,
      "text": "the greatest number is amongst motorists. So maybe if anyone should be forced to wear helmets,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.112427,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001328
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": 350.06,
      "end": 358.42,
      "text": "it should be them. Thanks for watching. Let us know what you think in the comments below,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.112427,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001328
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": 358.42,
      "end": 361.94,
      "text": "check out the other videos in this series and make sure you subscribe for more.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
